{"key":"apprecalc-mcq-033","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"A","final_answer":"(5/2)·8^x","working":"We use the properties of exponents to rewrite the expression 5·2^(3x−1):\n2^(3x−1) = 2^(3x) · 2^(−1) = (2^3)^x · (1/2) = (1/2)·8^x.\nMultiplying by 5 gives:\n5 · 2^(3x−1) = 5 · (1/2)·8^x = (5/2)·8^x.\nThis matches choice A.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":375,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":375,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":367,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":157,"reasoningTokens":210},"totalTokens":742,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":210,"promptTokenCount":375,"candidatesTokenCount":157,"totalTokenCount":742,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":375}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":157}]},"reasoningTokens":210,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3163,"keyed_label":"A"}
{"key":"apprecalc-mcq-np2-003","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"A","final_answer":"No -- the constant ratio itself is what establishes an exponential model; a high r-squared value alone is not sufficient justification","working":"In AP Precalculus and statistics, a high coefficient of determination (r-squared) does not alone validate that a specific model type is appropriate, as data from other function families can also yield high r-squared values over restricted domains. The fundamental defining characteristic of an exponential function is that output values change by a constant multiplicative factor over equal-length input intervals. Therefore, the constant ratio of successive outputs justifies the exponential model, making choice A correct.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":466,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":466,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":461,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":149,"reasoningTokens":312},"totalTokens":927,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":312,"promptTokenCount":466,"candidatesTokenCount":149,"totalTokenCount":927,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":466}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":149}]},"reasoningTokens":312,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3716,"keyed_label":"A"}
